@sardrobe/background-remover
Copyright (c) 2026 Omar Kawach

This package performs in-browser background removal for Sardrobe. It runs the
DIS ISNet "general-use" model on ONNX Runtime Web (WebGPU, with a WASM
fallback). It is distributed under the MIT License.

